===Format===
* '''Group Stage:''' ''May 16th - 18th, 2022''
** Four Double Round Robin groups
*** Each group has 4 teams 
*** Every team in a group will have a different regional seed
*** A group cannot have more than 2 teams from the same region
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-Tiebreaker" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for tiebreaker rules''</span>
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Tiebreaker" style="width:760px; margin-left:45px">
# Round difference
# Head-to-head
# Match Win percentage
# Round Win percentage
# Tiebreaker match
</div>

** {{bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} from each group advance to the '''[[Six_Major/2022/Stage_1#Playoffs|Playoffs]]'''
* '''Playoffs:''' ''May 20th - 22nd, 2022''
** Single-Elimination bracket
** 1st place vs 2nd place from each group. Randomized seeding.
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}, no map advantage.

